{"unit_id":"zsjs110110-cpu__dsh-cross-session-approval#feature-1","repo":"zsjs110110-cpu/dsh-cross-session-approval","commit":"a1bc57042bf052846fabf51d620381e0c6461d33","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session-approval 的功能「会话任务派发」：创建持久顶层会话并立即投递首条任务，工具返回后调用者可继续工作；子会话完成后可将结果回复给指定会话。 通过会话工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:863-896"]}
